  id: 0
  title: The Hallowed Seamstress
  role: Fighter
  passiveName: A Thousand Cuts
  passiveDescription: Every hit stitches a cut for 1% (+0.6% per 100 AP) of the target's max health as magic damage and heals you against champions. Swing your scissors through enemies, or hold the right trigger to auto-snip.
  patch: 16.19.1
  portrait: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 42235c8ccb5ea0541b66ebb090007cf0, type: 3}
  passiveIcon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 33d6b465b836f084592d808f5f7a693c, type: 3}
  spells:
  - name: Snip Snip!
    vrDescription: 'B: giant spectral scissors snip in front of you, 2 snips plus one per stored stack (attacks store up to 4, shown as beads on your blades). Point the blades where you want to cut; the centre line deals true damage and executes weak minions.'
    icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 9d756aac508d23546bd391d308403327, type: 3}
    cooldowns:
    - 6.5
    - 5.75
    - 5
    - 4.25
    - 3.5
    costs:
    - 40
    - 40
    - 40
    - 40
    - 40
  - name: Hallowed Mist
    vrDescription: 'X: raise a dome of Hallowed Mist around you. Enemies outside cannot target you (towers still can) and you gain armor and magic resist. Press X again to pull the mist to where you stand.'
    icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: d5969bdcc29e40642b2248129df35bb3, type: 3}
    cooldowns:
    - 22
    - 21
    - 20
    - 19
    - 18
    costs:
    - 60
    - 60
    - 60
    - 60
    - 60
  - name: Skip 'n Slash
    vrDescription: 'A: dash where you are walking with the stick (or where your blades point if you stand still), leaving an afterimage. Your blades glow: faster attacks, longer reach, bonus magic damage, and the first hit refunds cooldown.'
    icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 76a12dd4aa8c18b40bbba2ead65d8fcc, type: 3}
    cooldowns:
    - 13
    - 12.5
    - 12
    - 11.5
    - 11
    costs:
    - 35
    - 35
    - 35
    - 35
    - 35
  - name: Needlework
    vrDescription: Hold the left trigger to ready needles between your fingers (1, then 3, then 5), then release while throwing. The needles fly where your hand was moving and pull glowing threads; plain releases fly where your hand points.
    icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: f7f7768ca12aea84c82e3066efb89ed1, type: 3}
    cooldowns:
    - 120
    - 100
    - 80
    costs:
    - 100
    - 100
    - 100
